# MedRAG — Local Medical RAG System

## Environment Variables (create a .env file)

# LM Studio server (loads Qwen 3.5 9B Instruct)
LMSTUDIO_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1
LMSTUDIO_MODEL=lmstudio-community/Qwen3.5-9B-MLX-4bit

# Embedding model (local via sentence-transformers)
EMBEDDING_MODEL=jinaai/jina-embeddings-v5-small
# Fallback if jina-embeddings-v5-small isn't available:
# EMBEDDING_MODEL=BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5

# Database path
LANCEDB_DIR=./data/lancedb

# OCR engine: "chandra" (best, SOTA), "chandra-cli" (simpler), "marker", or "pymupdf" (fast fallback)
OCR_ENGINE=chandra